      "id": 1000972,
      "name": "Affinity with Your Rhythm",
      "desc": "Trigger has awakened the Mindscape Cinema: <color=#FFAF2C>[Sharpened Senses]</color>.\n[Sharpened Senses]: The Stun DMG Multiplier applied through <color=#FFFFFF>Core Passive: Soul-Searching Gaze</color> is increased by an additional 20%. When activating <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Harmonizing Shot</color>, the cooldown is reduced to 2s. <color=#FFFFFF>Purge</color> gained upon hitting an enemy with the continuous fire or charged counter in <color=#FFFFFF>Sniper Stance</color> increases by 25%. Maximum <color=#FFFFFF>Purge</color> increases to 125.",
      "desc2": "Remembering lost loved ones and those beside me, \"Trigger\" blew an original harmonica tune. The powerful will to protect now transforms into soaring fervor.",
